        "sender_full_name": "Jiaxi Mo",
        "timestamp": 1788684819
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The underscore is if it's only for Prop, right?</p>",
        "id": 622029692,
        "sender_full_name": "Ruben Van de Velde",
        "timestamp": 1788685794
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The underscore is only for separating tokens in Prop. <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TensorProduct.induction_on#doc\">docs#TensorProduct.induction_on</a> is indeed only for Prop, but Lean itself seem to be treating <code>inductionOn</code> as a single token.</p>",
